    "\n",
    "## Today’s outcomes\n",
    "1. Name the five phases of SDLC and the typical output of each.\n",
    "2. Compare Waterfall, Incremental, and Agile on three dimensions: requirements stability, feedback latency, and risk profile.\n",
    "3. Justify a model choice for your thread project with at least three project-specific reasons."
