    "### B4 · Pick a model for your thread project (5 min)\n",
    "Model: ☐ Waterfall  ☐ Incremental  ✅ Agile  ☐ Hybrid\n",
    "\n",
    "Three project-specific reasons:\n",
    "1. Requirements are uncertain since \"Mood\" has no single correct label, and requirements are far are hypotheses until interview confirm them. Agile itself makes each round of user feedback change the next iteration. \n",
    "2. The Machine Learning part needs repetitive build-test-adjust cycles. \n",
    "   Iteration 1: a single script that classifies one clip\n",
    "   Iteration 2: valence/arousal(a two-dimensional framework—often called the circumplex model of affect—used to map and understand human emotions based on how pleasant the feeling is and how energized the body feels)output\n",
    "   Iteration 3: correction button\n",
    "   These steps can expose failures at early stage.\n",
    "3. Since I will work as solo developer with a fixed deadline, need the flexible workflow with keeping tasks to change the mood labels or the model when testing shows they fail.\n"
   ]
